Error: check_rule_rejection_keeps_its_source_place.Fraction: `scale` scales whole numbers
  --> Tests/UI/MarkerDeclarations/check_rule_rejection_keeps_its_source_place.jet:26:17
    |
 26 |     print(scale(2.5))
    |                 ^^^
 Why: The scaling rule hears each argument's type
 Fix: Pass an Int

Error: Jet.ValueTypeMismatch: `3.7` isn't a whole number, so `Int` can't hold it exactly
  --> Tests/UI/MarkerDeclarations/check_rule_rejection_keeps_its_source_place.jet:27:12
    |
 27 |     n: Int{3.7}
    |            ^^^
 Why: An integer typed literal converts a Float only when no rounding is needed; it never picks a rounding for you
 Fix: Round it first, as in `Int{math.trunc(value)}`, or with `math.floor`, `math.ceil`, `math.round` or `math.round_even`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ValueTypeMismatch
